# Pins for the X applications (fetched at build; not vendored; the
# extension libraries they need are packages/x11-libs'). Release tarballs from
# https://www.x.org/releases/individual/, or the same files from the mirrors
# (as in packages/x11-libs); SHA-256 of the .tar.xz files.
